              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo curadka masaakiinta ayaa wax cuni doona, kuwa baahanna ammaan bay ku jiifsan doonaan, oo xididkaagana waxaan ku dili doonaa abaar, kuwa kaa hadhayna waa la layn doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
