              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddow, barooro. Magaaladaay, ooy! Reer Falastiin oo dhammow, kulligaa cabsi la dhalaal, waayo, waxaa woqooyi ka iman doona qiiq, oo midna saaxiibbadiis kama hadhi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.31",
